{"id":"n1-090","title":"Noun はさておき","romaji":"~ wa sateoki","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'putting aside', 'aside from', 'notwithstanding'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 'Noun はさておき' is used when highlighting something as an exception from an overall generalization, or when putting aside a particular matter before progressing to another point of discussion. The literal translation would be 'putting Noun aside', 'aside from Noun' or 'notwithstanding Noun.'","formation":"Noun + はさておき","examples":[{"jp":"試験の結果はさておき、この学期はとても学ぶことが多かった。","romaji":"Shiken no kekka wa sateoki, kono gakki wa totemo manabu koto ga ookatta.","en":"Aside from the exam results, I learned a lot this semester.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さておき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"さておく"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学期","vocabId":"1206650","reading":"がっき"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とても","vocabId":null},{"surface":"学ぶ","vocabId":"1206530","reading":"まなぶ"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多かった","vocabId":"1407460","reading":"おおかった","baseForm":"多い"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"天候はさておき、明日のピクニックは楽しみにしています。","romaji":"Tenkou wa sateoki, ashita no pikunikku wa tanoshimi ni shiteimasu.","en":"Putting aside the weather, I am looking forward to tomorrow's picnic.","words":[{"surface":"天候","vocabId":"1438970","reading":"てんこう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さておき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"さておく"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"明日","vocabId":"1584660","reading":"あした"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ピクニック","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"楽しみ","vocabId":"1207250","reading":"たのしみ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2]},{"jp":"彼の性格はさておき、彼のスキルは認めざるを得ない。","romaji":"Kare no seikaku wa sateoki, kare no sukiru wa mitomezaru wo enai.","en":"Notwithstanding his personality, his skills are undeniable.","words":[{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"性格","vocabId":"1375290","reading":"せいかく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さておき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"さておく"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"スキル","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"認め","vocabId":"1611790","reading":"みとめ"},{"surface":"ざるを得ない","vocabId":"2060970","reading":"ざるをえない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"彼があまりにも遅いことはさておき、彼が来ると思われること自体が問題だ。","romaji":"Kare ga amari ni mo osoi koto wa sateoki, kare ga kuru to omowareru koto jitai ga mondai da.","en":"Aside from him being late, the issue is that he is expected to come at all.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あまりに","vocabId":"1543890","reading":"あまりに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"遅い","vocabId":"1421970","reading":"おそい"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"さておき","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"さておく"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来る","vocabId":"1547720","reading":"くる"},{"surface":"と思われる","vocabId":"2435540","reading":"とおもわれる"},{"surface":"こと自体","vocabId":"2513530","reading":"ことじたい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7]}],"ki